    "updated_at": "2026-05-04T22:08:01Z",
    "body": "/cc @saschanaz - around colour picker.\n\nThis shouldn't be an issue for `base-select` as popovers close on removal, so this behavior falls out. For auto-select this may still be an issue in some engines (depending on what they use). So perhaps worth speccing.",
